<title>USA: Chairman's group gains control of Novatek.</title>
<headline>Chairman's group gains control of Novatek.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novatek International Inc said on Thursday the business partnership of the company's chariman, Jaime Puccio and other Latin American businessmen have obtained a controlling interest in Novatek.</p>
<p>The company said the group exercised its option to purchase all Novatek shares held by Pickerel Cove Trust, New England Diagnostics Ltd and Rudy Baboun.</p>
</text>
